sequenceDiagram
    actor HR as HR Manager
    participant UI as Pipeline UI
    participant DB as Firebase DB
    HR->>UI: Load Pipeline Kanban
    UI->>DB: Fetch Candidates & Stages
    DB-->>UI: Pipeline Data
    HR->>UI: Drag Candidate to 'Interview' Stage
    UI->>DB: Update Candidate Stage
    DB-->>UI: Update Confirmed
    HR->>UI: Schedule Interview Time
    UI->>DB: Create Interview Record
    DB-->>UI: Record Created
